WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.580
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:03.580
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:09.520
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:09.520
overflowing with love.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.090
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:20.030
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:24.050
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:24.050
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.490
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.490
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:31.260
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:31.260
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.540
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.540
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.980
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:38.980
the red moon is watching,

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.570
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.570
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:50.030
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:50.030
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.100
I can say love

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:53.830
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:53.830
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.830
will you love me?

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:57.440
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:57.440
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:00.390
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:00.390
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.950
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.950
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:08.600
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:08.600
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:31.740
Now then, let me show you the bridge.

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:34.850
Once there, you'll be given 
more details about the GP.

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:35.500
Right...

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:39.720
It doesn't really feel like we're inside a spaceship, though...

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:40.880
Oh, really?

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.970
Does it seem more like one now?

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.540
T-This is amazing!

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:54.680
Too amazing!

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:59.930
It's like we're really in outer space or something!

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:04.040
Earth's solar system is right over here.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:07.580
Earth...?

00:02:12.320 --> 00:02:15.830
It's even more beautiful than it looks on TV or in pictures!

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:17.930
Strange, don't you think?

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:21.130
This is a transport ship with very limited room for living quarters,

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:23.630
so almost everything was designed for multiple purposes.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.130
The interior designers went a little overboard.

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:31.110
Hey!

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:36.250
So everything has extra functions you wouldn't expect them to have.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:32.440
Hey!

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:33.660
Hey!

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:37.060
Help!

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:39.350
H-Hey! H-Help!

00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:42.050
Even the 2D washing machine called the "Galactic Whirlpool" is useless.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:46.070
It's supposed to be fully automatic, doing all the washing, rinsing and drying on its own...

00:02:57.480 --> 00:03:00.000
The Galaxy Police.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:04.520
We, the interstellar law enforcement agency, known as the GP,

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:07.390
cover over sixty percent of the Milky Way in our never-ending pursuit

00:03:07.390 --> 00:03:10.290
of peace throughout space.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:15.670
Equipped with the galaxy's latest technology and trained equally as well,

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:18.730
our officers yield to no criminals.

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:25.040
But the GP's work is not limited
 to outer space alone.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:28.940
It also extends to the underground and deep-sea realms.

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:35.620
GP officers constantly protect the people from lawbreakers who would threaten peaceful life.

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:38.260
Their actions are highly acclaimed throughout the galaxy,

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:42.090
and they receive medals of honor from countless nations abroad!

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:46.460
However, their duties are not limited to the capture of criminals!

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:48.900
Protecting the bright smiles of all people.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.960
That is the duty of the GP.

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:52.470
What's the matter, little girl?

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:53.600
My balloon...!

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:54.640
What?!

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:56.970
Magic Hand!

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:03.180
So why not join the ranks of the GP?

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:05.750
Act now and you'll not only receive your own set of the latest equipment,

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:10.650
but also this Magic Hand, a favorite at parties!

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:17.630
Don't hesitate to access the 
GP at the number below!

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.900
The GP's so cool!

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:22.670
Seina-kun.

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:23.250
Y-Yes!

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:27.130
Welcome to the Galaxy Police!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:30.000
Congratulations on entering the Galaxy Police!

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:33.510
T-Thank you...

00:04:34.010 --> 00:04:38.450
Output from energy generators 02 and 03 are synchronized and stable.

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.450
Engine pressure steady.

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:42.590
Internal pressure normal.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:44.250
The cargo room's air system is normal.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.210
No problems with the cargo.

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:51.500
Activate the hyperspace jump program!

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.960
Loading hyperspace jump program.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:56.000
Hyperspace jump?

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:56.950
Is that like warping?

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:59.370
Yes, something like that, I suppose...

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:00.840
Awesome!

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:03.810
It's actually possible?!

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:04.870
What does he expect?

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.850
Energy output increasing to 120.

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:10.880
130.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.080
135.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:12.810
140.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:13.990
Coordinates set.

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:17.320
Point G26, 380, N171...

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:20.290
This is so cool!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.460
We're actually going into warp!

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.890
Say, you should sit down or you might get hurt...

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:27.030
You're right.

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:28.200
Program complete.

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:31.630
Commencing hyperspace jump in ten seconds.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:32.610
Eight...

00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:33.140
Seven...

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.500
Here we go!

00:05:33.550 --> 00:05:34.500
Six...

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.210
Five...

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:36.170
Four...

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:36.940
Three...

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:37.770
Two...

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:38.870
One...

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:53.920
Warp! Warp!

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:56.060
Um...

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:57.130
What is it?

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:59.160
When are we going to jump?

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:00.400
We already started.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.500
We did? But when?

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.170
You heard the countdown, didn't you?

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:07.170
B-But isn't there supposed to be a big shock wave or something?

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:10.470
Aren't weird things supposed to appear and disappear and stuff?

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:11.580
No.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:16.010
No seat belts that wrap around us, no anti-shock system of some sort?

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:17.510
Unnecessary.

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:19.520
Clothes suddenly coming off for no reason...

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.220
Weird phenomenon that we
 can't possibly imagine...

00:06:22.220 --> 00:06:24.190
I'm afraid not.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:25.480
Aw, man...

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:31.790
Seina-kun! Are you all right?

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:33.430
Ow.

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:34.760
You liar!

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.230
What do you call that big shock?

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:37.370
No! This is something else...

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:40.000
Energy signature detected in the same space!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:40.550
A near miss?!

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:43.640
Judging from its energy output, it appears to be a large warship!

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:44.970
Emergency retreat!

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:51.480
There's nothing to worry about.

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:53.150
This sort of thing happens all the time.

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:54.250
Mitoto-sama,

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:58.290
the probability of a near miss out here is less than a trillion to one!

00:06:58.290 --> 00:06:59.820
Then we hit the jackpot!

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:03.960
What is our current position and damage status?

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:05.660
We're far off course!

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.500
The cell section has been slightly damaged,

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:11.100
but we can still get back on course.

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:11.940
Seina-kun.

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:14.470
It will take some time, but there's nothing to worry about.

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:16.170
Return to your room and get some rest.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:19.110
But...

00:07:19.110 --> 00:07:20.280
It's all right.

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:25.180
It is our mission to safely deliver our package to its destination.

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:34.890
Can this really communicate with Earth?

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:37.460
You can even see the person on the other end!

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:42.130
But there aren't any view screens on Earth, so they can't see us.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:43.230
I see...

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.470
Oh, yeah!

00:07:44.470 --> 00:07:50.040
If you want to call Earth you need to dial 4989 before the number.

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.680
4-9-8-9?

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:52.900
Call me if you need anything.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:54.890
I'll be on the bridge.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.220
4... 9...

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.580
8... 9...

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:12.680
Masaki residence.

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.400
Kai? It's me, Seina!

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.020
Seina?!

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.970
Hey, is Kiriko-san around?

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.600
She's out right now.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.940
So what's the deal with you suddenly dropping out of school?

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:23.070
And what hospital are you in this time?

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:24.670
I'm not in a hospital!

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:27.740
You'll never guess where I am right now!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:29.450
Well at least you sound okay.

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:33.320
I don't know where you hurt yourself this time, but take care of yourself.

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:39.250
Kai, didn't Kiriko-san tell you to stop putting your hands in your pants to scratch your butt?

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:42.390
Where are you?!

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:43.790
Where are you hiding?!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.430
I'm not hiding anywhere.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:47.760
I can see you.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:50.430
You can see me, huh?!

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:51.640
In here?!

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:52.270
Or...

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:53.100
Hey! Kai!

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.040
...in here?!

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:54.770
Kai!

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:55.510
Here?!

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:56.070
Come on!

00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:56.810
Here?!

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:57.910
Hello?!

00:08:57.910 --> 00:08:58.680
Here?!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.270
Kai-kun...

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:02.280
I'll call back some other time.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.070
Oh, yeah.

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.460
Come on!

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:15.960
I know you're there!

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:17.130
Pick up!

00:09:17.130 --> 00:09:20.760
Mom, Dad, Yoshiko... anyone!

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.170
Pick up the phone!

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:23.230
I need to tell Kiriko-san that I-

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:24.830
Hello! Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:25.970
This is Yamada Shop!

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:28.100
Hi, it's me!

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:30.910
Huh? Who?

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:32.440
It's me!

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:34.210
Kiriko-san's there, right?!

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.580
Oh, is that you, Seina?

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:36.580
How are you?

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:38.480
Everyone here is doing just great!

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:39.950
Well, gotta go. Things are really busy right now...

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.380
Bye-bye!

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:42.030
Wait!

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:43.220
Yoshiko, don't hang up!

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.590
Kiriko-san's there, right?!

00:09:44.590 --> 00:09:45.620
Let me talk to her!

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:46.460
Kiriko-san?

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:47.360
Oh, there she is.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:48.830
How did you know?

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:50.860
Just hurry up and let me talk to her!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.240
Yeah, yeah.

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:53.860
Kiriko-san!

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:55.570
Kiriko-san!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.570
There's a phone call
for you from my brother!

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.330
Could you talk to him?

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:03.430
Hello? Seina-chan?

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:08.570
Hello? Kiriko-san?

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:13.020
Level One emergency alert is in effect.

00:10:13.020 --> 00:10:16.790
As a result, this call
has been disconnected.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:20.160
Be advised that no calls will be allowed
until the emergency alert is over.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.090
I repeat...

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:22.730
Level One emergency alert?

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:25.690
So pretty...

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:30.410
W-What?

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:54.220
T-This is just like in the movies...

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:59.460
What are pirates doing in this sector?!

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:00.840
Enemy vessel approaching!

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:01.600
It's coming after us!

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:04.440
Shall we surrender?

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:05.850
We can't do that.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:10.450
Things would get a lot uglier if the pirates found out you were on board.

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.660
Distance to enemy vessel at 6800!

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:17.330
Reroute all auxiliary power to the main system.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:20.710
But we'll be without our weapons if we do that...

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:24.210
Even with this ship's weapons we wouldn't stand a chance.

00:11:24.640 --> 00:11:27.270
This ship happens to be one of the GP's finest—

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:29.740
—transport ships.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.350
So let's run away.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:33.910
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:36.680
Strengthening forward shields in preparation for the energy net!

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.430
Shields to maximum power!

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:41.390
W-What's going on?

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.220
The pirates are firing warning shots at us!

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:45.530
P-Pirates?!

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:48.350
You mean pirates are real too?

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:51.660
They're the very reason that the Galaxy Police is needed!

00:11:51.660 --> 00:11:54.410
Our only option is to run away for now, though.

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:00.190
Conduction circuits 303 and 448 damaged.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:01.060
Auxiliary engine power is-

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.920
Our communication system's on!

00:12:04.110 --> 00:12:05.870
They've been listening to us this whole time?

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:06.610
Oh, my!

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:09.260
I hope I didn't say anything silly.

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:11.020
Right, Mr. Pirate people?

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:13.290
Turn it off at once!

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:14.930
Sounds like they finally noticed.

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:18.830
Too late, though.

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:20.430
Prepare the energy nets.

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:24.190
Send out the usual once they've slowed down.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:29.590
We'll be okay... We'll be okay...

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:35.700
Energy detected directly ahead!

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:40.650
It's an energy net.

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.750
An energy net has opened up
 directly in front of us!

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:43.980
Steer around it!

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:44.500
Roger!

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:00.850
We've successfully cleared the net!

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:02.510
Alright!

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.790
More energy nets ahead!

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:07.220
Decreasing speed!

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.710
No way!

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:10.880
Energy coming from the enemy ship behind us!

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:12.680
There are three Level Two energy signatures!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:14.650
They're closing in on us!

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:18.280
Brace for impact!

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.290
Hits confirmed!

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.140
We have rats on board!

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:40.220
Traps on!

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.660
The rats have penetrated Block Five!

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:55.980
Th-They're fast!

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.040
Must be a new model!

00:13:58.260 --> 00:13:59.660
They've taken control of Block Two!

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:00.860
They've broken into Block Three!

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:01.740
They're heading for the bridge!

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:03.700
That's fine.

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.160
We've got a new model, too.

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:09.200
Do we have the Movement Predictor 
Program Version 9.2?

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.800
That's three versions old.

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:13.340
It executes more quickly.

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:14.670
Try it, if you would.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.930
<i>Man, I'm completely useless...</i>

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.480
Rate of extermination is increasing rapidly!

00:14:21.480 --> 00:14:23.180
65... 77...

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:24.430
It'll soon be over 90!

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.850
No hope for a takeover...

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:27.820
Concentrate on the engines!

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:28.640
Stop 'em in their tracks!

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:48.840
They've gotten conduction circuits 03 and 05!

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:49.870
Rat extermination complete!

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:51.880
Engine power decreasing!

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:52.780
120!

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:53.750
100 and dropping!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.550
Enemy ship closing in!

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:56.260
It's chasing us down!

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:59.520
This could be a very dangerous maneuver...

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:00.840
...but we have no other choice, do we?

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:03.350
Prepare for random jump!

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:09.520
Fill Corridor Three with crystal gel and use it as energy bypass.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:11.770
Understood!

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.740
Engine power rising!

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:20.320
We can go!

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:23.410
The enemy ship is still approaching...

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:24.320
Cannon fire detected!

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:26.210
Course set...

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:27.420
Okay!

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.870
Initiate random jump!

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.830
That's some risk you're taking.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.560
Looks like you got some 
valuable treasure on board.

00:15:41.560 --> 00:15:42.180
Hey, Tipster.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.640
Leave it to me.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:55.150
Random jump complete!

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:57.640
Determine present positions of pirates.

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:58.680
Wait!

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.860
Energy signature detected behind us!

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:02.680
Impossible!

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:04.360
The enemy ship is exiting a jump!

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:08.500
Jump complete!

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.620
Target detected!

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.290
Excellent work.

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:14.630
Target has jumped again.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:16.080
Well?

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:19.370
They're wasting their time 
with their random jumps.

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:24.500
I've completed my analysis of their latest random jump program.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.970
And besides...

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:31.180
What about now?

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:32.560
Energy signature behind us!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.750
It's no use!

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:38.760
I've only been trained to safely deliver cargo!

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.560
It's too easy for them to anticipate my course changes!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:46.030
Setting random courses does require specialized training.

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:48.120
S-So then what do we do?!

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:49.410
That's it!

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:52.050
Why don't we let Seina-chan set our course?

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:52.910
Good thinking!

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:54.770
Seina-kun is a complete novice!

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:56.080
M-Me?!

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:57.520
That's right!

00:16:57.520 --> 00:16:59.290
Enter a new jump course at random!

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:00.550
Please!

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:01.800
Please!

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:10.810
I-I don't think this is such a good idea...

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:14.810
Target's preparing to random jump again.

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:17.560
It still won't help them...

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:23.520
First jump is nearly complete.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.070
Exiting into normal space!

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:30.240
A sudden near miss?!

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.630
Second jump complete!

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:39.100
N-Not again...

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:40.360
Third jump!

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:44.880
Fourth!

00:17:56.230 --> 00:17:57.280
H-Hurry!

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:58.220
Jump again!

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:07.100
We've lost power to the engines!

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:08.740
We can't random jump!

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:10.400
Gravity waves detected!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:11.330
It's all the previous ships!

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:19.110
Oh my, this is bad...

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:21.510
I have the worst luck...

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:23.340
Enemy ships approaching!

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:37.010
It's no use.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:37.810
We've been caught.

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:40.190
There's too many of them to make a break for it!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:44.780
We've successfully captured the target!

00:18:45.070 --> 00:18:47.640
We found this prey first!

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.410
Don't let any other ships get it!

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:50.030
Roger!

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:02.150
W-What is that?!

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:05.620
Is it a GP decoy ship?

00:19:05.620 --> 00:19:09.300
If so, it's done such a fine job that I'd like to recruit it for myself...

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:15.310
I feel as if I've found a bag containing jewels that had been scattered throughout a desert.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.030
But how did they do it?

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:22.060
There've been no reports of pirate ships from our fleet...

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:24.440
Seto-sama!

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:27.820
All data on the ships, including the target craft, has been gathered!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:30.950
All ships, prepare for ambush!

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:33.570
Don't let a single one get away!

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:40.080
You can all forget about your bonuses if any other ships beat us to it!

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:42.210
What's going on?!

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:44.040
Massive energy field detected!

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.780
The only ships with this much power are...

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:47.800
It must be a royal ship!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:49.510
What...?!

00:19:49.510 --> 00:19:50.390
Emergency retreat!

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:52.430
I can't get the ship under control!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:59.430
We're picking up a signal in
 an older navigation code!

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:00.480
It's an amazing energy output!

00:20:01.160 --> 00:20:03.900
An old galactic navigation code?

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:04.480
It can't be!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:06.230
The Triple-Z!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:10.240
Cut the power to all weapons
 and energy systems!

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:12.140
That'll leave us without life support!

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:12.950
Just do it!

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:16.380
No matter what, do not attack, evade, or retreat!

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:18.780
Tell all the other ships to do the same!

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:19.480
Hurry!

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.710
All ships must stop immediately!

00:20:21.710 --> 00:20:22.460
What's going on?!

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:25.120
The Triple-Z is issued when the Mikagami's about to ambush someone!

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.380
It's the Devil Princess of Jurai's genocide dance!

00:20:58.280 --> 00:21:00.450
Oh, isn't that the Mikagami?

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:02.220
T-The Mikagami?!

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:03.960
Are we saved?

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:07.470
Really?

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:11.000
The Mikagami is hailing all ships in the vicinity.

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:12.400
Attention all ships.

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:18.510
I, Kamiki Seto Jurai, hereby declare you all under arrest for acts of piracy.

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:20.970
Kamiki Seto Jurai...

00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:23.410
I-It's the Devil Princess of Jurai...

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:24.810
Devil Princess?

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:30.650
Um, uh... Pretend you didn't hear that.

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:33.610
Is she a really scary person?

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:37.660
You don't know anything about Jurai, do you?

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:41.680
She's a powerful political figure who belongs to the nation...

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:44.540
with the greatest military power in the galaxy.

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:46.790
She's a very delightful person!

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:49.790
You're the only one able to say that, Mitoto-sama!

00:21:52.070 --> 00:21:53.370
Mikagami...

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:55.550
The Devil Princess of Jurai...

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:21.660
uchuu de saitei saiaku

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:21.660
You're the worst, most hopeless,

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:26.780
un warui Unlucky Boy

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:26.780
most unlucky boy in space.

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:33.990
anna koto shite te mo

00:22:32.320 --> 00:22:33.990
No matter what you do,

00:22:35.010 --> 00:22:36.720
konna koto shite te mo

00:22:35.010 --> 00:22:36.720
no matter what you do,

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:41.510
otozureru jiko tensai sugoi wana

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:41.510
you can't escape the accidents, disasters and traps

00:22:41.510 --> 00:22:43.800
anata wa nigerarenai

00:22:41.510 --> 00:22:43.800
that come your way.

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:47.370
keikai shite te mo

00:22:45.600 --> 00:22:47.370
Even if your really careful...

00:22:48.350 --> 00:22:50.080
ikinari shichatte mo

00:22:48.350 --> 00:22:50.080
And even if you're not...

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:56.310
saitei saiaku dame dame no

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:56.310
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:22:56.310 --> 00:23:00.780
anata wa doshiyou mo nai

00:22:56.310 --> 00:23:00.780
You're a lost cause.

00:23:05.630 --> 00:23:10.730
anata ga saitei saiaku

00:23:05.630 --> 00:23:10.730
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:15.350
anata wa Unlucky Boy

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:15.350
You're an unlucky boy.

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:20.430
dakedo anata shika mienai

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:20.430
But all I can see is you.

00:23:20.610 --> 00:23:25.950
sonna anata shika mienai

00:23:20.610 --> 00:23:25.950
But all I can see is you, the way you are.

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:33.470
The large fleet that
saved us from the pirates.

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:35.970
At the center of the
fleet floats the Mikagami.

00:23:35.970 --> 00:23:37.310
And the powerful political figure

00:23:37.310 --> 00:23:39.310
and member of the galaxy's
most powerful military nation...

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:40.480
Kamiki Seto.

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:41.950
What exactly is she like?

00:23:41.950 --> 00:23:43.980
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!
